[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5824.55, "timestamp": "01:37:04", "text": "斯图斯蒂，而且仍然在这里。 A，我们是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5827.03, "timestamp": "01:37:07", "text": "我们仍在沟通，仍在合作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5830.47, "timestamp": "01:37:10", "text": "现在。那可是件大事，甚至比这还重要。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5832.149, "timestamp": "01:37:12", "text": "如果我和塞拉斯蒂娅待的时间太长，我就会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5833.91, "timestamp": "01:37:13", "text": "仍然喜欢和你一起玩。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5838.87, "timestamp": "01:37:18", "text": "你，你懂得爱，你，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5840.55, "timestamp": "01:37:20", "text": "因为就像有些人一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5843.43, "timestamp": "01:37:23", "text": "我在过去四年里遇到的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5845.91, "timestamp": "01:37:25", "text": "我想要我所说的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5848.149, "timestamp": "01:37:28", "text": "即使如此，我仍然会维持与他的友谊"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5858.43, "timestamp": "01:37:38", "text": "我的天哪，我不知道该怎么办"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5865.43, "timestamp": "01:37:45", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5868.709, "timestamp": "01:37:48", "text": "然后我意识到，呃，我感觉就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5872.189, "timestamp": "01:37:52", "text": "起初我懂得不多，但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5876.629, "timestamp": "01:37:56", "text": "但从你的角度来看，不是……呃……如何"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5879.75, "timestamp": "01:37:59", "text": "那是我第一次发现"}]